<title>UK: LME aluminium firm, but off highs in AM ring.</title>
<headline>LME aluminium firm, but off highs in AM ring.</headline>
<text>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Stronger, but off fresh 19-month highs seen on pre-market.  Cash/threes holds at $2/$5 backwardation.</p>
<p>ZINC - Three months unchanged, spreads wider at $90/$95 backwardation.  LEAD/TIN - Slightly firmer.</p>
<p>COPPER - Touch weaker, cash/threes narrower at $30 backwardation.  NICKEL - Barely changed.</p>
</text>
